'''Cracks''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Cracks uses the same design as the [[Default Knife]], but with large black cracks all over the blade, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Cracks (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

